@startuml 3.6.21 - Remove Hashtag Collection
title Sequence Diagram — 3.6.21 - Remove Hashtag Collection

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "Web dashboard" as webdashboard
boundary "HashtagController" as hashtagcontroller
control "HashtagService" as hashtagservice
entity "WorkspaceRepository" as workspacerepository
entity "HashtagRepository" as hashtagrepository
actor "CREATOR / CLIENT / MANAGER" as creatorclientmanager

' === Flow ===
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Check removal rights, version and required-tag policy
creatorclientmanager -> webdashboard: Select Remove hashtag
webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display warning and current scope
creatorclientmanager -> webdashboard: Confirm removal
webdashboard -> hashtagcontroller: DELETE /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/hashtags/{hashtagId}
hashtagcontroller -> hashtagservice: removeHashtag(user, command)
hashtagservice -> workspacerepository: Load workspace access
workspacerepository --> hashtagservice: Workspace
hashtagservice -> hashtagrepository: Load hashtag and required scope
hashtagrepository --> hashtagservice: Hashtag

loop invalid access / policy violation / conflict
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found / 409 Conflict
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found / 409 Conflict
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display access or conflict error
end

hashtagservice -> hashtagrepository: Soft-remove hashtag entry
hashtagrepository --> hashtagservice: writeOutcome

alt writeOutcome committed
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 204 No Content
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 204 No Content
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display entry removed from collection
else write failed or version conflict
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display save error; retain previous values
end

@enduml
